0 -14 Td /F1 10 Tf (• Dr. Ines Vardakis is a Senior Research Scientist at the Eskerfield Learning Research) Tj
0 -14 Td /F1 10 Tf (  Institute, where she studies how students seek and use feedback in large-enrolment courses.) Tj
0 -14 Td /F1 10 Tf (  Her recent work compares instructor, peer and automated feedback in first-year writing and) Tj
0 -14 Td /F1 10 Tf (  STEM gateway courses.) Tj
0 -14 Td /F1 10 Tf (• Emeka Nwosu-Hart is Associate Professor of Chemistry at TU Kestrow. He teaches CHEM 110, one) Tj
0 -14 Td /F1 10 Tf (  of the largest first-year courses on campus, and has spent the past year experimenting with) Tj
0 -14 Td /F1 10 Tf (  AI-generated practice problems and office-hours triage.) Tj
0 -14 Td /F1 10 Tf (• Constance Wilberforce is Professor of History at TU Kestrow, where she teaches historical) Tj
0 -14 Td /F1 10 Tf (  methods and the history of information. She has written on evidence, authority and the) Tj
0 -14 Td /F1 10 Tf (  archive, and is a frequent and welcome critic of educational technology claims.) Tj
